{"headword":"נָכְרִי","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj.</strong> foreign, alien <strong>(</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִי</span> = <em>Gentile</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. m. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.8\">Zp 1:8</a> +; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:22\" href=\"/Exodus.2.22\">Ex 2:22</a> +; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.6\">Is 2:6</a> + 2 times + <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.16\">Pr 20:16</a> Kt (> Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span>), + <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.13\">27:13</a> (so read for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span>); fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:15\" href=\"/Genesis.31.15\">Gn 31:15</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>foreign:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם נָכְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:8\" href=\"/Exodus.21.8\">Ex 21:8</a> (E) <em>a foreign</em> (non-Isr.) people, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.15\">Dt 17:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא אָחִיךָ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְבּוּשׁ נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.8\">Zp 1:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ נָכְרִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:22\" href=\"/Exodus.2.22\">Ex 2:22</a> (J) <em>foreign land</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:3\" href=\"/Exodus.18.3\">18:3</a> (E); especially <span dir=\"rtl\">נָשִׁים נָכְרִיּוֹת</span> <em>foreign</em> (non-Isr.) <em>women</em> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.1\">1 K 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:2\" href=\"/Ezra.10.2\">Ezr 10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:10\" href=\"/Ezra.10.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:11\" href=\"/Ezra.10.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:14\" href=\"/Ezra.10.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:17\" href=\"/Ezra.10.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" href=\"/Ezra.10.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:44\" href=\"/Ezra.10.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.26\">Ne 13:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.27\">27</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִי</span> <em>foreigner</em> (non-Isr.) <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:12\" href=\"/Judges.19.12\">Ju 19:12</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר לֹא מִבְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.41\">1 K 8:41</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר לֹא מֵעַמְּךָ</span>), = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:32\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.32\">2 Ch 6:32</a> (+ <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:43\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.43\">1 K 8:43</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:33\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.33\">2 Ch 6:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.21\">Dt 14:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.3\">15:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.21\">23:21</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָחִיךָ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.21\">29:21</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֶׁר יָבֹא מֵאֶרֶץ רְהוֹקָה</span>); as predicate, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.19\">2 S 15:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּלָה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:10\" href=\"/Ruth.2.10\">Ru 2:10</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִים</span> <em>foreigners</em> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.2\">La 5:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:11\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.11\">Ob 11</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>); cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, נָכְרִי\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_נָכְרִי\">יַלְדֵי נָכְרִים</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 2:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.2.6\">Is 2:6</a>; fpl. <em>alien women</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:15\" href=\"/Genesis.31.15\">Gn 31:15</a> (E; i.e. not of one’s father’s family)."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span> <em>foreign woman</em>, as term. techn., in Pr, for <em>harlot</em> (perhaps because harlots were orig. chiefly foreigners): <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.16\">Pr 2:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה זָרָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.5\">7:5</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.20\">5:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זָרָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.24\">6:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשֶׁת רָ֑ע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.27\">23:27</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זוֹנָה</span>).—On <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.16\">20:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.13\">27:13</a> v. infr."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. <em>unknown, unfamiliar:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִי הָיִיתִי בְּעֵינֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:15\" href=\"/Job.19.15\">Jb 19:15</a> <em>an alien am I become in their eyes;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ לִבְנֵי אִמִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:9\" href=\"/Psalms.69.9\">ψ 69:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּזָר הָיִיתִי לְאֶחָ֑י</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 6:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.6.2\">Ec 6:2</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s judgment, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה עֲבֹדָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.21\">Is 28:21</a> <em>strange is his task!</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זָר מַעֲשֵׂהוּ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּפֶן נָכְרִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.21\">Je 2:21</a> <em>an alien vine</em> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרַע אֱמֶת</span>), fig. of degenerate Israel; as subst., <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.16\">Pr 20:16</a> Kt (> Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span>), <em>aliens</em>, persons unknown to him (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זָר</span>), so read also (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">נָכְרִיָּה</span>) ‖ <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.13\">27:13</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.10\">5:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.2\">27:2</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB06334","strong_numbers":["5237"],"next_hw":"נכר²","prev_hw":"נֵכָר","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["5799"],"TWOT":["1368c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}